flowchart LR
  Customer([Customer]) -->|places order| A
  subgraph Fulfilment
    A[Receive order] -->|validate| B[Check stock]
    B -->|reserve| C[Reserve items]
    C -->|charge| D[Take payment]
    D -->|confirm| E[Send confirmation]
    E -->|pick| F[Pick items]
    F -->|pack| G[Pack parcel]
    G -->|label| H[Print label]
    H -->|hand over| I[Dispatch]
  end
  I -->|delivers to| Customer
